{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01953","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 织锦窦家妻 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 织锦窦家妻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年谁不羡，分作窦家妻。\n锦字行行苦，罗帷日日嗁。\n岂知登陇远，祗恨下机迷。\n直候阳关使，殷勤寄海西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}